WEBVTT

02:19.560 --> 02:21.160
She can survive seven days

02:22.480 --> 02:24.080
without food or water.

02:24.960 --> 02:26.840
She's not an ordinary girl.

02:27.440 --> 02:29.960
This woman is a shadow guard
sent from Chang'an.

02:30.720 --> 02:32.720
Before her identity was exposed,

02:33.680 --> 02:36.280
she claimed she came to Tiemo
as a merchant.

02:36.920 --> 02:38.920
She has lived here alone for seven months.

02:40.280 --> 02:44.000
A lot of information was sent back
to Chang'an through her.

02:45.880 --> 02:49.080
These shadow guards share
a common name in Chang'an.

02:49.840 --> 02:50.800
They are the Huben Army.

02:52.040 --> 02:54.040
-Huben Army?
-Yes.

02:55.280 --> 02:57.080
There's a person called Liu Ziwen
in Chang'an

02:57.680 --> 02:59.200
who put them through systematic training

02:59.280 --> 03:02.800
and sent these people to Tiemo in secret.

03:04.040 --> 03:08.000
Liu Ziwen was just
an administrative official.

03:09.720 --> 03:10.600
Do you want to go to Chang'an?

03:11.280 --> 03:13.800
Of course. There's tea in Chang'an.

03:19.360 --> 03:21.640
The information obtained from this woman

03:22.280 --> 03:24.040
has helped turn the tide of war.

03:24.840 --> 03:27.880
I heard the people
on Mount Shiluoman's altar

03:28.480 --> 03:30.240
wanted you to go further north.

03:30.320 --> 03:32.040
Do you no longer want this opportunity?

03:32.680 --> 03:34.240
Does it matter?

03:36.160 --> 03:38.080
Even if I become the king of Tiemo,

03:39.040 --> 03:41.240
I can only live with everyone else

03:41.320 --> 03:44.000
on this barren, frozen land.

03:53.920 --> 03:56.040
If we want to end Tiemo's suffering,

03:56.120 --> 03:59.840
we must head south and go to Chang'an.

04:04.600 --> 04:05.600
I have an idea.

04:06.640 --> 04:08.440
We can also do the same as Liu Ziwen.

04:09.120 --> 04:10.280
We'll train shadow guards

04:10.800 --> 04:13.000
and send them to Chang'an.

04:13.080 --> 04:15.960
We'll let them blend
into every corner of Chang'an.

04:17.000 --> 04:19.920
It might take five years or thirty years.

04:20.920 --> 04:22.680
When Chang'an is at its weakest,

04:22.760 --> 04:24.640
it'll be the moment when we,
the Tiemo people,

04:25.560 --> 04:27.160
come out of our suffering.

04:29.600 --> 04:30.600
Not us.

04:31.720 --> 04:32.600
Only you.

04:34.560 --> 04:36.720
What? Cen Pickles.

04:37.800 --> 04:39.560
You're not going to Chang'an with me?

04:42.200 --> 04:43.360
We shouldn't go together.

04:44.400 --> 04:45.760
We shouldn't do the same thing.

04:46.680 --> 04:50.200
Even if we meet in Chang'an one day,

04:50.280 --> 04:52.080
even if we are beside Liu Ziwen,

04:53.120 --> 04:54.360
we must not reunite.

04:55.400 --> 04:58.680
I believe doing so as a shadow guard

04:58.760 --> 04:59.880
is the only way to deceive

04:59.960 --> 05:02.320
Liu Ziwen,
who is good at using shadow guards.

05:02.920 --> 05:04.480
Only by deceiving Liu Ziwen,

05:05.000 --> 05:07.040
can we deceive all our enemies.

05:07.880 --> 05:10.800
That is how we can achieve
something great.

05:11.320 --> 05:12.840
Yes. You are right.

05:13.960 --> 05:14.920
You've grown sharper.

05:17.480 --> 05:19.800
Cen Pickles, you've become smarter.

05:20.560 --> 05:21.760
Let me say one more thing.

05:21.840 --> 05:24.280
You must not die
before our great cause is achieved.

05:28.920 --> 05:30.480
If I die, I fear no one will help

05:32.120 --> 05:33.680
collect your dead body.

05:34.480 --> 05:35.320
That is reason enough

05:35.400 --> 05:36.960
for me to stay alive.

05:37.040 --> 05:40.360
Sure. We must both be alive.
See you in Chang'an.

06:03.520 --> 06:04.880
Open his mouth.

06:05.520 --> 06:06.880
Look for a small metal piece.

06:06.960 --> 06:08.000
Yes.

06:09.880 --> 06:10.840
Open!

06:12.920 --> 06:13.920
Sir, there's nothing.

06:21.200 --> 06:24.320
Do you find it fun to humiliate me?

06:25.720 --> 06:27.280
I'm not humiliating you.

06:36.520 --> 06:37.480
Don't you know?

06:38.160 --> 06:40.760
Xie Huai'an will come
and rescue you later.

06:45.840 --> 06:47.840
Both of you have a strong bond.

06:48.920 --> 06:50.760
He fears you would rather kill yourself

06:50.840 --> 06:52.600
than let him risk his life to save you.

06:53.600 --> 06:54.840
You can't die yet.

06:54.920 --> 06:56.160
Is that not true?

07:00.920 --> 07:01.920
-Move.
-Move.

07:15.360 --> 07:16.720
About the wonton stall…

07:17.360 --> 07:18.560
I went there last night.

07:19.160 --> 07:20.160
No one was there.

07:21.080 --> 07:22.400
No signs of an ambush.

07:24.320 --> 07:25.320
Right.

07:25.960 --> 07:29.240
Xie Huai'an won't set up ambush
at a place that has been exposed.

07:30.440 --> 07:34.280
What will he try to do this time?

07:58.800 --> 07:59.800
Mister.

08:00.440 --> 08:02.280
The street is empty.

08:02.360 --> 08:05.320
No one is coming to buy wine today.

08:07.640 --> 08:10.560
Whether anyone comes or not
is unimportant.

08:11.160 --> 08:15.160
What's important for me is sitting here.

08:19.760 --> 08:21.240
A war is starting.

08:21.320 --> 08:23.920
Mister, why aren't you leaving?

08:25.120 --> 08:27.000
I'm already seated here.

08:27.600 --> 08:29.000
Where else can I go?

08:35.720 --> 08:36.919
But if we lose

08:38.039 --> 08:39.640
and Chang'an falls,

08:40.960 --> 08:42.159
you will

08:45.360 --> 08:46.640
also die.

08:47.400 --> 08:52.320
The fall of a city
and death are inevitable.

08:53.000 --> 08:56.720
But Heaven and Earth

08:57.680 --> 08:59.040
won't change, right?

09:06.480 --> 09:07.480
You're right.

09:10.440 --> 09:12.000
Heaven and Earth won't change.

09:12.920 --> 09:14.680
Then, I'll sit here.

09:27.000 --> 09:29.880
All I have is cheap wine.

09:30.480 --> 09:31.720
I'm not buying wine today.

09:32.480 --> 09:34.280
I'm only buying a bench.

09:34.360 --> 09:36.320
-A bench…
-Please accept it.

10:10.160 --> 10:14.120
LONGSHENG RESTAURANT, CHEN'S PASTRY SHOP

10:49.040 --> 10:50.040
Xie Huai'an.

10:50.120 --> 10:51.200
Xie Huai'an!

10:51.280 --> 10:52.880
Don't be foolish!

10:53.560 --> 10:55.680
Xie Huai'an. Run!

10:55.760 --> 10:57.400
Run!

10:58.520 --> 11:01.640
What are you doing?
Why did you come here alone?

11:01.720 --> 11:04.240
Xie Huai'an, are you listening?

11:04.320 --> 11:05.800
Xie Huai'an!

11:12.120 --> 11:13.440
Xie Huai'an.

11:13.520 --> 11:15.120
What trick are you trying to pull?

11:15.800 --> 11:18.640
Where are your strategies and ambushes?

11:21.960 --> 11:23.600
I'm the only one here.

11:25.400 --> 11:26.400
Don't worry.

11:30.320 --> 11:31.160
Xie…

11:32.480 --> 11:34.760
The King of Tiemo wants to get rid of me.

11:35.720 --> 11:37.640
I'm at my wits' end.

11:39.720 --> 11:41.240
Rather than resist,

11:42.280 --> 11:45.840
I chose to bid farewell to my friend

11:47.720 --> 11:49.240
before I die.

11:50.400 --> 11:51.920
When this is over,

11:52.640 --> 11:54.000
I

11:55.200 --> 11:56.720
leave myself at Tiemo's mercy.

12:03.040 --> 12:04.800
This place is secure.

12:05.880 --> 12:07.920
Even if I meet my pageboy here,

12:08.000 --> 12:10.560
we won't be able to escape.

12:12.920 --> 12:15.240
It's a small wish from a man about to die.

12:17.080 --> 12:18.640
I hope you'll allow it.

12:23.160 --> 12:25.160
You resisted us alone for so long

12:25.240 --> 12:27.800
and finally surrendered.

12:28.400 --> 12:31.480
I will fulfill the wish of a dying person.

12:33.040 --> 12:34.040
Let him out.

13:23.320 --> 13:24.320
You've suffered.

13:37.160 --> 13:38.160
Why?

13:44.960 --> 13:46.400
Why didn't you listen to me?

13:48.880 --> 13:49.960
Why did you come?

13:56.480 --> 13:57.600
I know

13:58.520 --> 14:00.400
I can't save you at this moment.

14:02.960 --> 14:04.760
But I have something to tell you

14:05.640 --> 14:07.240
so I waited for you here.

14:07.840 --> 14:09.640
But if you do this, you'll…

14:09.720 --> 14:11.080
I have to

14:12.600 --> 14:14.200
meet the King of Tiemo sooner or later.

14:19.840 --> 14:21.160
This is my destiny.

14:26.240 --> 14:27.560
Xie Huai'an,

14:28.720 --> 14:30.120
are you throwing your life away?

14:32.360 --> 14:33.840
What will I do if you die?

14:35.600 --> 14:37.040
What about Ye Zheng?

14:37.880 --> 14:39.080
What about Xiaoqing?

14:41.480 --> 14:43.720
Even if you don't care about us,

14:45.880 --> 14:47.120
what about Bai Wan?

14:50.680 --> 14:54.680
When she was alive,
she wanted you to stay alive.

15:03.840 --> 15:05.840
People die and return to dust.

15:09.760 --> 15:11.800
We can't go to another world.

15:14.960 --> 15:16.080
It's also impossible

15:18.040 --> 15:19.760
to meet our family members who died.

15:22.240 --> 15:23.240
Staying alive

15:25.160 --> 15:26.680
is the only way to remember the dead.

15:30.560 --> 15:31.640
I came here today

15:34.480 --> 15:36.360
to bid farewell to you.

15:39.960 --> 15:42.120
But if you do this, you will really die.

15:48.360 --> 15:49.480
Don't worry.

15:50.480 --> 15:51.480
I guarantee

15:53.120 --> 15:54.600
we'll surely meet again.

15:56.800 --> 15:58.800
However, this is important.

16:00.680 --> 16:01.880
I believe

16:03.480 --> 16:04.480
you will surely

16:05.880 --> 16:07.240
get this done.

16:13.320 --> 16:14.320
Go.

16:33.120 --> 16:39.120
QINGYUN PAVILION

16:45.960 --> 16:46.960
I used to say

16:47.800 --> 16:49.560
that I was the only one
who could keep you alive.

16:50.920 --> 16:52.480
I gave you Mo's face

16:53.680 --> 16:56.080
and made you a pageboy to protect you.

16:57.600 --> 16:59.520
You might not have what it takes
to be an emperor,

17:00.880 --> 17:02.400
but you know the suffering of the people.

17:03.600 --> 17:05.280
After the war is over,

17:06.079 --> 17:07.920
if you are willing
to leave your past behind

17:08.480 --> 17:09.480
and remain at court,

17:10.680 --> 17:12.400
it will be a blessing to the world.

17:17.440 --> 17:18.880
If that day does come,

17:20.079 --> 17:21.560
will you still be by my side?

17:26.640 --> 17:27.480
I will.

17:28.200 --> 17:29.440
When that day arrives,

17:30.480 --> 17:32.040
I will be your pageboy.

18:09.400 --> 18:11.120
You look calm.

18:11.200 --> 18:13.440
You don't look like you're here to die.

18:21.280 --> 18:24.040
Where I die isn't important.

18:24.960 --> 18:28.200
I only know
that the person who shares my goal

18:28.920 --> 18:31.080
is already in front of the King of Tiemo.

20:36.280 --> 20:37.120
Free him.

20:50.800 --> 20:51.680
This way, please.

21:32.480 --> 21:33.320
He's here.

21:34.080 --> 21:35.080
I'm cooking the lamb.

21:37.200 --> 21:38.760
It seems I arrived at the right time.

21:41.520 --> 21:44.000
However, there's not enough firewood.

21:57.560 --> 21:58.720
Let me do it.

22:37.440 --> 22:38.920
When was this stove last used?

22:39.000 --> 22:40.840
The stove is too wet.

22:41.760 --> 22:43.040
I don't know.

22:45.040 --> 22:46.480
It might be an unusable stove.

22:55.520 --> 22:58.000
Young man,
you are still too inexperienced.

23:10.520 --> 23:12.000
The stove is too wet.

23:18.520 --> 23:19.760
Books burn faster.

23:24.320 --> 23:25.400
I want to burn books too.

23:26.040 --> 23:27.240
Are you willing to…?

23:27.840 --> 23:29.080
I would never have done it.

23:29.880 --> 23:32.400
Now, both of you are here.

23:35.320 --> 23:36.320
Burn it.

23:49.000 --> 23:49.920
What a good book.

23:51.800 --> 23:52.640
I'm burning it.

24:11.400 --> 24:12.600
White Hair.

24:14.000 --> 24:15.600
You want me dead so badly.

24:17.280 --> 24:19.080
If I'm dead,

24:20.200 --> 24:22.320
do you still have somewhere to go?

24:26.120 --> 24:29.560
I hid in Huainan for seven years.

24:31.120 --> 24:34.360
I had a job at a remote place.

24:36.480 --> 24:37.480
It was relaxing.

24:38.920 --> 24:41.880
I used to help the people

24:41.960 --> 24:44.800
go down the field, plant paddy,

24:45.840 --> 24:46.840
and harvest the grains.

24:49.400 --> 24:50.480
Now that I think about it,

24:51.400 --> 24:53.160
I actually miss the place.

24:53.240 --> 24:55.800
It certainly sounds
like a prosperous place.

24:58.600 --> 24:59.600
No.

25:00.440 --> 25:02.240
Huainan isn't a prosperous place.

25:03.120 --> 25:04.880
A single natural disaster

25:05.480 --> 25:06.600
would bring famine.

25:09.120 --> 25:10.840
Some despicable magistrates

25:10.920 --> 25:12.400
refused to open the granaries.

25:14.560 --> 25:16.360
I broke open granaries once

25:17.520 --> 25:18.640
and was imprisoned.

25:28.960 --> 25:30.200
And if I die,

25:31.960 --> 25:33.120
do you have somewhere to go?

25:38.440 --> 25:39.440
I don't.

25:45.080 --> 25:46.840
I can no longer return

25:47.600 --> 25:49.840
to where I've been before.

25:56.520 --> 25:58.600
I was a slave when I was young.

25:59.280 --> 26:02.080
My father also grew up as a slave.

26:03.080 --> 26:05.200
In the noble families of Tiemo,

26:05.280 --> 26:08.280
slaves use themselves as bait

26:08.360 --> 26:11.240
to lure out the wolves and kill them.

26:12.640 --> 26:16.320
Then, the sheep in the pen can survive.

26:18.200 --> 26:19.320
Because of that,

26:19.400 --> 26:22.160
they don't care no matter
how many slaves they sacrifice.

26:23.560 --> 26:24.560
In the end,

26:25.760 --> 26:27.560
I retrieved my father's limbs

26:28.760 --> 26:30.640
in the mouth of a wolf.

26:35.000 --> 26:36.840
I still remember

26:38.280 --> 26:39.920
the feeling of hunger back then.

26:42.400 --> 26:43.720
But even if

26:45.920 --> 26:47.440
your father is dead,

26:48.200 --> 26:51.880
your master still won't
give you a full meal.

26:53.000 --> 26:56.560
Later, more slaves followed me.

26:57.320 --> 27:00.040
I only wanted to capture a town

27:00.640 --> 27:03.640
but the feeling of hunger
still followed me.

27:04.760 --> 27:05.760
Later,

27:06.560 --> 27:07.920
after that,

27:09.200 --> 27:11.720
I want to dominate the world.

27:21.080 --> 27:22.880
Today is a farewell.

27:24.120 --> 27:25.360
One only

27:26.720 --> 27:29.240
speaks sincerely at a farewell.

27:33.120 --> 27:34.120
Speaking of which,

27:35.440 --> 27:37.640
how White Hair broke open
a granary in Huainan

27:38.640 --> 27:40.320
resembled what we did when we were young.

27:40.960 --> 27:41.920
Yes.

27:45.360 --> 27:46.520
Ten years ago?

27:47.200 --> 27:48.320
Twenty years ago?

27:48.400 --> 27:49.760
No.

27:49.840 --> 27:51.520
It was 40 years ago.

28:19.320 --> 28:22.560
There are so many sheep, but they
still force us to kill and eat wolves.

28:22.640 --> 28:23.640
Wolf meat tastes sour.

28:23.720 --> 28:24.600
Death is inevitable.

28:24.680 --> 28:26.120
Let's feast while we can.

28:28.720 --> 28:29.600
Must we die?

28:32.280 --> 28:33.520
Do you have a way?

28:35.400 --> 28:38.200
Those who kill for the nobles
are also slaves.

28:39.120 --> 28:40.200
If they come after us,

28:40.280 --> 28:42.600
I will tell them what we did.

28:43.960 --> 28:45.280
I'm going to ask them

28:45.360 --> 28:47.240
why nobles can kill slaves
without punishment

28:47.920 --> 28:49.560
but when a slave kills a noble,

28:49.640 --> 28:51.160
they will be punished.

28:51.240 --> 28:52.360
I also want to ask them

28:53.040 --> 28:55.280
why can't we be the nobles
and let them be the slaves.

28:55.360 --> 28:56.160
-Yes!
-Yes!

28:56.240 --> 28:57.200
Exactly.

28:57.280 --> 28:58.840
We can also become nobles.

28:58.920 --> 29:00.040
Exactly.

29:01.320 --> 29:03.320
We can become someone
who kills sheep without remorse.

29:03.400 --> 29:05.360
We can kill another person
without being punished.

29:12.440 --> 29:14.000
Are you scared?

29:14.680 --> 29:15.680
No.

29:16.280 --> 29:18.120
It has nothing to do with what you said.

29:19.680 --> 29:22.520
I didn't expect the meat to be so fatty.

29:23.120 --> 29:25.720
I wish I had some pickles
to cut through the greasiness.

29:26.440 --> 29:28.040
Look at you.

29:28.120 --> 29:29.440
-You're utterly useless.
-Just look at yourself.

29:30.040 --> 29:31.440
You're so lame.

30:21.160 --> 30:22.600
After we came to Chang'an,

30:23.400 --> 30:25.560
we did not reunite for over 20 years.

30:26.640 --> 30:27.560
In case

30:28.360 --> 30:29.600
we encountered a cunning enemy.

30:31.800 --> 30:34.520
Today, you get to see the result.

31:15.520 --> 31:16.720
My dear teacher,

31:18.720 --> 31:20.360
your move

31:25.000 --> 31:26.480
is impressive.

31:29.120 --> 31:30.120
White Hair,

31:31.440 --> 31:32.480
tell me.

31:33.720 --> 31:36.200
What is your purpose in living?

31:37.640 --> 31:40.080
If you do all this for fleeting memories,

31:41.440 --> 31:42.920
it's only natural for you to lose to me.

31:53.920 --> 31:54.920
You

31:56.120 --> 31:58.320
want to dominate the world.

32:02.720 --> 32:03.720
Isn't it because

32:04.840 --> 32:06.800
you want to become

32:06.880 --> 32:09.640
the slave masters you killed back then?

32:11.840 --> 32:15.760
You grow in the spring
and harvest in the autumn.

32:16.720 --> 32:18.720
Life and death are irreversible.

32:19.520 --> 32:21.640
But the cycle of power struggles
continues endlessly.

32:29.000 --> 32:30.400
As for you,

32:34.960 --> 32:36.560
if you want to become a slave master,

32:40.400 --> 32:42.560
you won't have a place to go.

32:48.600 --> 32:49.600
You're wrong.

32:57.240 --> 32:59.320
Sometimes you win. Sometimes you lose.

33:00.520 --> 33:01.440
Today,

33:03.320 --> 33:04.680
I win.

33:20.160 --> 33:21.520
Let's go.

33:25.840 --> 33:27.400
Don't you want to see him die?

33:28.920 --> 33:30.080
He is White Hair.

33:32.200 --> 33:33.080
Right.

33:33.680 --> 33:34.840
He is White Hair.

33:36.200 --> 33:39.040
His life has been full of hardship.

33:40.280 --> 33:41.280
So,

33:42.200 --> 33:44.320
he should die in this desolate place

33:45.320 --> 33:46.920
with no one beside him.

33:47.440 --> 33:48.720
No friends,

33:49.280 --> 33:50.720
not even his enemies,

33:51.360 --> 33:52.920
will witness his end.

33:55.080 --> 33:56.080
Hold on.

33:58.040 --> 33:59.680
I must take these lamb chops back.

34:00.400 --> 34:02.120
I'll give them to my neighbors.

34:02.800 --> 34:04.480
This is enough for them
to have a feast tonight.

34:06.160 --> 34:08.199
You have nowhere to go but I do.

34:10.600 --> 34:11.800
-Let's go.
-Let's go.

34:48.960 --> 34:49.960
Zhi.

35:07.560 --> 35:08.560
Father.

35:13.360 --> 35:14.360
Li.

35:15.960 --> 35:17.200
Zhi.

35:34.960 --> 35:35.960
I still

35:38.840 --> 35:40.320
don't want to die.

35:45.360 --> 35:46.360
I still want…

35:49.400 --> 35:50.400
I still want…

36:04.920 --> 36:06.640
I still want to remember all of you.

36:43.600 --> 36:45.080
I felt a chill run down my spine.

36:45.880 --> 36:46.880
Why?

36:48.880 --> 36:49.960
Stop pretending.

36:50.840 --> 36:51.840
If I had

36:52.640 --> 36:54.400
killed White Hair a moment later inside,

36:54.480 --> 36:56.320
you would've killed me.

37:00.480 --> 37:01.920
White Hair

37:02.880 --> 37:06.240
is more dangerous than Xiao Wuyang
and Yan Fengshan.

37:06.920 --> 37:08.360
He must die.

37:09.320 --> 37:12.880
Because of that, I can kill anyone
who stops me from killing him.

37:13.840 --> 37:15.480
After the Liu family was wiped out,

37:16.600 --> 37:18.600
you went missing for 15 years.

37:19.800 --> 37:22.520
I had no choice but to be cautious of you.

37:22.600 --> 37:24.680
I'm sure this is reasonable.

37:31.640 --> 37:32.640
Cen Pickles.

37:34.360 --> 37:36.320
You made up stories about your neighbors

37:37.320 --> 37:40.000
and even removed and drained the lamb

37:40.080 --> 37:42.160
to stall for time.

37:45.280 --> 37:49.080
You wanted to prove
that you didn't feel sorry for White Hair.

37:51.440 --> 37:52.640
That was far too deliberate.

37:53.360 --> 37:56.680
I did it because I couldn't
trust you completely.

37:58.440 --> 37:59.520
Luckily, I did it.

38:01.000 --> 38:02.440
He is just

38:02.520 --> 38:04.840
the son of an acquaintance
and of an enemy.

38:04.920 --> 38:06.400
An unparalleled genius.

38:07.240 --> 38:10.960
For your ambition, he had to die.

38:13.680 --> 38:15.400
It's the ambition of the Tiemo people.

38:19.880 --> 38:21.640
I didn't make up stories
about my neighbors.

38:22.680 --> 38:25.120
I really want to bring the lamb back.

38:26.760 --> 38:28.520
Those who are lazy

38:29.280 --> 38:32.600
will usually leech for free food
at my place.

38:33.480 --> 38:35.600
I even gave them nicknames.

38:35.680 --> 38:37.560
There's Gulouzi

38:40.000 --> 38:42.040
and Gourd Chicken.

38:54.480 --> 38:57.960
In this world, we need some bad friends.

39:16.160 --> 39:17.440
White Hair is already dead.

39:18.760 --> 39:20.120
I need to bring back the lamb.

39:21.280 --> 39:22.280
After tonight,

39:23.680 --> 39:25.240
Chang'an will belong to you.

39:30.320 --> 39:31.160
Tomorrow,

39:31.960 --> 39:34.080
I'll bring some Huoshan Huangya tea.

39:34.160 --> 39:35.160
What do you think?

39:35.800 --> 39:36.800
Sure.

39:51.480 --> 39:52.600
As for you,

39:54.360 --> 39:56.000
if you want to become a slave master,

39:59.760 --> 40:02.000
you won't have a place to go.

40:05.240 --> 40:07.280
You have nowhere to go but I do.

41:58.640 --> 41:59.640
He's completely dead?

42:00.440 --> 42:01.480
Yes.

42:02.000 --> 42:03.000
You got your wish.

42:03.640 --> 42:04.920
Drinking tea and killing people.

42:05.600 --> 42:07.320
Just like the person we admired.

42:08.960 --> 42:10.360
Why did you come back?

42:11.080 --> 42:12.480
Our worthiest enemy is dead.

42:13.160 --> 42:15.080
I'm worried that you might feel lonely.

42:16.080 --> 42:17.320
Why not come with me?

42:22.760 --> 42:27.320
There's lamb, pickles, and premium tea.

42:27.400 --> 42:28.920
It's much better than this place of yours.

42:29.000 --> 42:31.320
You can't even light the stove here.

42:32.360 --> 42:33.720
Huoshan Huangya tea?

42:38.880 --> 42:42.400
Your residence is just as I imagined.

42:43.120 --> 42:44.920
It's not that quiet.

42:45.920 --> 42:48.120
The prison is quiet
but I can't stay there.

42:51.720 --> 42:54.960
If you don't mind,
come and chat with me often.

42:55.520 --> 42:58.400
However, you must first
help me dry the pickles.

43:00.480 --> 43:01.560
Sure thing.

43:03.480 --> 43:04.880
Two children born slaves

43:05.720 --> 43:07.080
who weren't eaten by wolves

43:08.360 --> 43:10.560
experienced a chaotic period.

43:10.640 --> 43:14.120
We met each other
after hiding for more than a decade.

43:14.840 --> 43:17.200
We should spend days catching up.

43:18.320 --> 43:20.320
We were once only children born slaves.

43:20.960 --> 43:24.480
Neither of us would expect
that one day, we could live in Chang'an

43:25.160 --> 43:27.560
and decide the fate of this city.

43:28.240 --> 43:29.240
I expected it.

43:31.600 --> 43:33.640
I've expected it since the day

43:34.320 --> 43:35.320
we picked up the blade.

43:44.800 --> 43:46.520
After so many years,

43:47.200 --> 43:48.400
you have gotten old.

43:51.400 --> 43:52.920
You are one to talk.

43:54.240 --> 43:55.720
We should be old.

43:55.800 --> 43:58.440
If we are not, we become demons.

44:01.600 --> 44:02.600
Do you know?

44:03.600 --> 44:05.600
When I dream at night,

44:05.680 --> 44:07.840
I usually see us when we were young

44:08.640 --> 44:10.440
with sheep in the grasslands

44:11.080 --> 44:12.080
and wolves.

44:12.880 --> 44:14.560
They stare at me, baring white fangs.

44:16.000 --> 44:18.440
I always wake up in a cold sweat.

44:20.480 --> 44:21.560
Cen Pickles!

44:22.440 --> 44:23.440
Cen Pickles!

44:25.920 --> 44:28.160
You're so rude. Call me Grandpa.

44:28.240 --> 44:30.400
Cen Pickles! Your house has been robbed.

44:30.480 --> 44:31.400
What?

44:32.040 --> 44:35.160
Gulouzi and the rest
took all your pickles and meat.

44:35.240 --> 44:37.280
They said war was coming
and feared shortages.

44:48.560 --> 44:50.120
My house was robbed.
Forgive my poor hospitality.

44:52.200 --> 44:53.160
Where did they take it?

44:53.240 --> 44:55.440
The granary over there!

44:58.800 --> 45:00.040
-Are you going after them?
-Yes!

45:00.120 --> 45:01.160
I'll beat them up badly!

45:01.240 --> 45:02.360
Bring me along!

45:13.680 --> 45:14.800
Don't kill them.

45:14.880 --> 45:15.720
Teach them a lesson.

45:15.800 --> 45:17.600
Just teach them a lesson.

45:18.400 --> 45:19.840
Cen Pickles.

45:19.920 --> 45:20.920
You are old.

45:21.000 --> 45:22.480
You might lose.

45:22.560 --> 45:24.800
Let me lead the charge.
I promise I won't kill them.

46:16.600 --> 46:17.560
I have a large family and business.

46:18.160 --> 46:19.600
I must bring back these lamb chops.

46:20.480 --> 46:22.040
I'll give them to my neighbors.

46:22.840 --> 46:24.360
This is enough for a feast tonight.

46:24.960 --> 46:26.920
Those who are lazy

46:27.000 --> 46:30.120
will usually leech for free food
at my place.

46:30.200 --> 46:31.840
I even gave them nicknames.

46:33.160 --> 46:34.480
There's Gulouzi

46:35.440 --> 46:37.080
and Gourd Chicken.

46:37.760 --> 46:41.280
In this world, we need some bad friends.

46:51.880 --> 46:53.960
Why did you give your neighbors

46:55.480 --> 46:57.840
the names of our dead friends
as their nicknames?

46:58.880 --> 47:01.080
I remember what White Hair said to me.

47:02.400 --> 47:04.400
He could kill Yan Fengshan

47:05.800 --> 47:10.800
because he believes
he is someone who lives in a lie.

47:10.880 --> 47:12.800
His younger sister is dead

47:14.040 --> 47:16.160
but he can see
his younger sister's spirit.

47:17.080 --> 47:19.680
All humans have a fatal weak spot.

47:20.600 --> 47:21.720
So, he came up with the idea

47:22.560 --> 47:25.200
of disguising an assassin
as Yan Fengshan's adopted son

47:26.640 --> 47:27.560
to fake his son's revival

47:29.800 --> 47:32.280
and kill Yan Fengshan when he is

47:33.120 --> 47:34.040
at his most vulnerable.

47:34.800 --> 47:37.800
Killing someone
by using their fatal weak spot.

47:39.640 --> 47:41.000
How exquisite.

47:43.120 --> 47:44.400
Yan Fengshan stood no chance.

47:46.080 --> 47:47.720
So do I.

47:48.480 --> 47:51.160
Gulouzi and Gourd Chicken

47:51.760 --> 47:53.080
were dead.

47:53.160 --> 47:54.320
They have been dead for decades.

47:55.720 --> 47:58.080
I gave my neighbors these nicknames

47:59.840 --> 48:01.200
to lie to myself.

48:02.400 --> 48:05.080
You are lying to me.

48:05.160 --> 48:08.920
White Hair told me you'd never trust me.

48:09.840 --> 48:11.440
The only way to solve this

48:11.520 --> 48:14.200
is to use his life as a lure.

48:15.600 --> 48:17.720
I've known you for more than 40 years.

48:19.400 --> 48:21.600
I've always seen you as a friend.

48:21.680 --> 48:23.200
We are friends,
but we walk different paths.

48:23.280 --> 48:25.360
You killed too!

48:25.440 --> 48:28.440
I killed so more people can live.

48:28.520 --> 48:29.600
You killed

48:30.320 --> 48:33.520
because you want to become
the slave masters we killed.

48:34.280 --> 48:35.600
War ravaged Chang'an

48:36.200 --> 48:37.160
and corpses lie everywhere.

48:37.680 --> 48:38.760
This isn't what I want.

48:41.120 --> 48:42.280
Cen Pickles!

48:42.360 --> 48:43.560
If I die,

48:46.200 --> 48:47.200
do you still

48:49.040 --> 48:50.760
have anywhere to go?

49:38.520 --> 49:42.400
White Hair sacrificed himself
to achieve your goal.

49:44.960 --> 49:46.400
Who are you?

49:54.080 --> 49:55.680
When do we act?

49:55.760 --> 49:56.800
What is the signal?

49:56.880 --> 49:58.120
Tomorrow,

49:59.160 --> 50:00.480
at the hour of Shen.
